{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "t001",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 02 · HARDWARE ASSEMBLY — breadboard map\nLayout is a **RECOMMENDED placement method**, not a record of the physical board. No photo of the actual breadboard exists. Coordinates follow `docs/complete-breadboard-layout.md`.",
      "x": -1180,
      "y": -1150,
      "width": 1000,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "#c2410c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t002",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Read first** — [[docs/complete-breadboard-layout.md]] · [[docs/COMPLETE-BEGINNER-ASSEMBLY-GUIDE.md]] · [[docs/power-and-safety.md]]\nUnplug USB before adding a wire. One subsystem at a time.",
      "x": -1180,
      "y": -980,
      "width": 1000,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "#92400e"
    },
    {
      "id": "g003",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "POWER RAILS  —  UNVERIFIED, never measured",
      "x": -1180,
      "y": -790,
      "width": 1000,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "#92400e"
    },
    {
      "id": "t004",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**GND rail**\ncommon return",
      "x": -1150,
      "y": -720,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#c2410c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t005",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**3V3 rail**\n3.3 V logic only",
      "x": -810,
      "y": -720,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#c2410c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t006",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**VIN / 5 V USB**\never inject while on USB",
      "x": -470,
      "y": -720,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#92400e"
    },
    {
      "id": "t007",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "⚠ Do not bridge 3V3↔GND · never put 5 V on a GPIO or an I2C pull-up · CR2032 is RTC-backup only",
      "x": -1150,
      "y": -590,
      "width": 660,
      "height": 90,
      "color": "#92400e"
    },
    {
      "id": "g008",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "ESP32 ACROSS THE CENTRE TRENCH",
      "x": -1180,
      "y": -540,
      "width": 1000,
      "height": 420,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t009",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**left header**\nA B C D **E** ‖ **F** G H I J",
      "x": -1150,
      "y": -470,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 90,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t010",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**right header**\nUSB toward the top",
      "x": -860,
      "y": -470,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 90,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t011",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**P01–P15** are custom labels for the ESP32 pin rows, not printed breadboard numbers.\nDo not force a board that will not sit in E/F naturally — use a jumper harness instead.",
      "x": -1150,
      "y": -360,
      "width": 660,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t012",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Reserved: **GPIO1/3** USB serial · **GPIO25/26** loopback test only (jumper TX→RX, sensor detached)",
      "x": -1150,
      "y": -230,
      "width": 660,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "#1d3557"
    },
    {
      "id": "g013",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "SIGNAL ROWS  —  every entry is a SOURCE → GPIO → DESTINATION claim",
      "x": 60,
      "y": -790,
      "width": 1900,
      "height": 640,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t014",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### I2C BUS  —  P16–P20",
      "x": 90,
      "y": -720,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 90,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t015",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**OLED SDA**\n→ GPIO21",
      "x": 90,
      "y": -610,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#c2410c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t016",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**OLED SCL**\n→ GPIO22",
      "x": 400,
      "y": -610,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#c2410c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t017",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**DS3231 SDA**\n→ GPIO21 (shared)",
      "x": 720,
      "y": -610,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#c2410c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t018",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**DS3231 SCL**\n→ GPIO22 (shared)",
      "x": 1030,
      "y": -610,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#c2410c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t019",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Pull-ups must stay in the 3.3 V domain.**\nAn I2C ACK proves a listener, not a voltage.",
      "x": 1360,
      "y": -610,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#92400e"
    },
    {
      "id": "t020",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**I2C BUS**  GPIO21 SDA / GPIO22 SCL  @ 100 kHz  —  shared by OLED and RTC",
      "x": 90,
      "y": -480,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t021",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### GPIO OUTPUTS  —  P21–P28",
      "x": 90,
      "y": -330,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 90,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t022",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**GPIO18**\n→ green LED anode\n**via series resistor**",
      "x": 90,
      "y": -220,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t023",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**GPIO19**\n→ red LED anode\n**via series resistor**",
      "x": 400,
      "y": -220,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t024",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**GPIO23**\n→ buzzer IN\n**driver if current > GPIO**",
      "x": 710,
      "y": -220,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t025",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**GND rail**\nall LED cathodes\ncommon return",
      "x": 1020,
      "y": -220,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#c2410c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t026",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Never a bare LED across GPIO and ground.\nNever an unknown/high-current load on a GPIO.",
      "x": 1330,
      "y": -220,
      "width": 590,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#92400e"
    },
    {
      "id": "t027",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### UART  —  existing owner-reported assembly, DO NOT REBUILD",
      "x": 90,
      "y": -80,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 90,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t028",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**R307S TX (yellow)**\n→ **GPIO32 RX**\no valid response",
      "x": 90,
      "y": 30,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t029",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**R307S RX (green)**\n← **GPIO33 TX**\ndirection never independently tested",
      "x": 420,
      "y": 30,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t030",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**R307S pin1 (red)**\n→ **VIN**\nvoltage NOT measured",
      "x": 750,
      "y": 30,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "#92400e"
    },
    {
      "id": "t031",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**R307S pin2 (black)**\n→ **GND**",
      "x": 1080,
      "y": 30,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "#c2410c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t032",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**pins 5/6**\nblue/white open",
      "x": 1410,
      "y": 30,
      "width": 240,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "#525252"
    },
    {
      "id": "t033",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**TOUCH circuit**\nirrelevant to UART",
      "x": 1690,
      "y": 30,
      "width": 230,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "#525252"
    },
    {
      "id": "g034",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "ESP32 ACROSS THE CENTRE TRENCH",
      "x": -1180,
      "y": -540,
      "width": 1000,
      "height": 420,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "g035",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "ASSEMBLY ORDER  —  incremental, power off between steps",
      "x": -1180,
      "y": 200,
      "width": 1000,
      "height": 620,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t036",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "0 · unplug all power",
      "x": -1150,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 940,
      "height": 40,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t037",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1 · place ESP32",
      "x": -1150,
      "y": 295,
      "width": 940,
      "height": 40,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t038",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2 · place OLED",
      "x": -1150,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 940,
      "height": 40,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t039",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3 · place RTC",
      "x": -1150,
      "y": 385,
      "width": 940,
      "height": 40,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t040",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "4 · LEDs + resistors",
      "x": -1150,
      "y": 430,
      "width": 940,
      "height": 40,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t041",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "5 · buzzer module",
      "x": -1150,
      "y": 475,
      "width": 940,
      "height": 40,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t042",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "6 · verified power + ground only",
      "x": -1150,
      "y": 520,
      "width": 940,
      "height": 40,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t043",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "7 · add I2C",
      "x": -1150,
      "y": 565,
      "width": 940,
      "height": 40,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t044",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "8 · add indicators",
      "x": -1150,
      "y": 610,
      "width": 940,
      "height": 40,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t045",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "9 · preserve the existing R307S UART",
      "x": -1150,
      "y": 655,
      "width": 940,
      "height": 40,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t046",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "10 · inspect everything",
      "x": -1150,
      "y": 700,
      "width": 940,
      "height": 40,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t047",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "11–20 · run the component tests in order",
      "x": -1150,
      "y": 745,
      "width": 940,
      "height": 40,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "g048",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "BEFORE YOU POWER UP",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 200,
      "width": 960,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "#92400e"
    },
    {
      "id": "t049",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "☐ no 3V3-to-GND bridge",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 34,
      "color": "#92400e"
    },
    {
      "id": "t050",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "☐ no 5 V path to a GPIO",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 288,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 34,
      "color": "#92400e"
    },
    {
      "id": "t051",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "☐ every LED has a series resistor",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 326,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 34,
      "color": "#92400e"
    },
    {
      "id": "t052",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "☐ no reversed module polarity",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 364,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 34,
      "color": "#92400e"
    },
    {
      "id": "t053",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "☐ RTC charging circuit identified before any CR2032",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 402,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 34,
      "color": "#92400e"
    },
    {
      "id": "t054",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "☐ no exposed sensor leads",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 440,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 34,
      "color": "#92400e"
    },
    {
      "id": "t055",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "☐ USB is the only supply",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 478,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 34,
      "color": "#92400e"
    },
    {
      "id": "g056",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "UNVERIFIED — the honest part",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 200,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t057",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**No photo of the real board exists.** P-row numbers, wire colours and physical\npositions are a *placement method*, not an observation.\n\nEverything electrical is **UNVERIFIED — REQUIRES MULTIMETER**:\nR307S rail, TX level, jumper state, OLED/RTC supply compatibility,\nLED resistor values, buzzer current, every ground path.",
      "x": 1030,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 840,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "f058",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "docs/complete-breadboard-layout.md",
      "x": -1180,
      "y": 860,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#475569"
    },
    {
      "id": "f059",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "docs/COMPLETE-BEGINNER-ASSEMBLY-GUIDE.md",
      "x": -680,
      "y": 860,
